; An interpolated price keeps the exponent its division leaves: 110.00 over
; 2 is 55.00.
2020-01-01 open Assets:EUR
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-02 * "price interpolated"
  Assets:EUR  1 EUR @
  Assets:A   -110.00 USD
2020-01-03 * "price interpolated, total"
  Assets:EUR  2 EUR @@
  Assets:A   -110.00 USD
2020-01-04 * "price interpolated, currency given"
  Assets:EUR  3 EUR @ USD
  Assets:A   -110.00 USD
